From 6d5e304540a652adfe632a69350e6b739c0899f3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 04:38:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(auth): HTTPS confirm links, OTP entry, and deletion
 feedback
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Email CTAs now use https://www.choremaxx.app/auth/callback so Mail
links are tappable; the website agent bridges into the app.

Confirm-email gains a primary code entry path, pending signup is
persisted, and auth/callback times out instead of spinning forever.

Settings → Delete account opens a two-step Apple-calm flow with
optional churn feedback (submit_account_deletion_feedback migration).
